"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-06-29T17:36:13Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T05:59:08Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:50:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108118","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108118","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108118.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108118.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-18T17:50:28Z"},"body":"Reduce complexity of these two functions with initializer list constructor.\r\n\r\n`varray` should be ok because it is used together with `sarray`, so not performace critical.\r\n\r\nFor `vformat` I run both microbenchmark and a test project:\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>code</summary>\r\n\r\n```C++\r\n#define ANKERL_NANOBENCH_IMPLEMENT\r\n#include \"nanobench.h\"\r\n#include \"core/templates/list.h\"\r\n#include \"core/templates/local_vector.h\"\r\n\r\nclass Test\r\n{\r\npublic:\r\n    static void bench()\r\n    {\r\n        String fmt = \"Test vformat %s %04d-%02d-%02d %02d:%02d:%02d\";\r\n        auto bench = ankerl::nanobench::Bench()\r\n            .minEpochIterations(1000);\r\n        bench.run(\"vformat\", [&]{\r\n            for (int i = 0; i < 100; i++) {\r\n                auto r = vformat(fmt, \"test\", 2023, 10, 5, 12, 30, 45);\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>result</summary>\r\n\r\n\r\nmaster:\r\n|               ns/op |                op/s |    err% |     total | benchmark\r\n|--------------------:|--------------------:|--------:|----------:|:----------\r\n|          223,433.91 |            4,475.60 |    0.4% |      2.67 | `vformat`\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n|               ns/op |                op/s |    err% |     total | benchmark\r\n|--------------------:|--------------------:|--------:|----------:|:----------\r\n|          220,315.97 |            4,538.94 |    0.4% |      2.63 | `vformat`\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>code</summary>\r\n\r\n```GDScript\r\nextends Node2D\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar times = []\r\n\tfor i in range(10):\r\n\t\tvar start = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\t\tfor j in range(100000):\r\n\t\t\tTime.get_datetime_string_from_unix_time(1751215307)\r\n\t\tvar end = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\t\tprint((end - start) / 1000.0, \" ms\")\r\n\t\ttimes.append((end - start) / 1000.0)\r\n\tvar avg = 0.0\r\n\tfor t in times:\r\n\t\tavg += t\r\n\tavg /= times.size()\r\n\tprint(\"average: \", avg, \" ms\")\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>result</summary>\r\n\r\nmaster:\r\n175.029 ms\r\n172.557 ms\r\n170.201 ms\r\n172.307 ms\r\n172.757 ms\r\n172.753 ms\r\n172.192 ms\r\n171.617 ms\r\n171.543 ms\r\n173.941 ms\r\naverage: 172.4897 ms\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n171.95 ms\r\n170.445 ms\r\n170.952 ms\r\n168.081 ms\r\n169.044 ms\r\n170.402 ms\r\n170.3 ms\r\n171.469 ms\r\n171.817 ms\r\n169.767 ms\r\naverage: 170.4227 ms\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nboth tests show no regressions.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108118/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108118/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}